OL,3,GGrampian
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FThere will be a mixture of
OL,6,Fsunny intervals and occasional
OL,7,Fblustery showers, accompanied by
OL,8,Fstrong to gale southwesterly winds,
OL,9,Fperhaps severe at first towards the
OL,10,Fnorth coast. Best of sunshine and
OL,11,Ffewest showers across eastern
OL,12,FAberdeenshire.
OL,13,
OL,14,CTonight:FOccasional showers will
OL,15,Fcontinue across Moray and the west,
OL,16,Fwith a few also reaching the east
OL,17,Fcoast, though the best of the clear
OL,18,Fspells will be here. Winds easing
OL,19,Ffurther.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
